B.Wv=new A.hQ(1,"Pre-Placement Barn Preparation","Disinfection, dry bedding, and 24-hour preheating","1 min read",B.a83,"Prevents early chick chilling \u2014 stops up to 80% of first-week losses.","Before broiler chicks arrive, the barn must be completely cleaned, washed, and disinfected.\n\n\u2022 Preheat the barn to 33-34\xb0C at least 24 hours in advance.\n\u2022 Spread dry wood shavings 5-7 cm deep.\n\u2022 Fill nipple or bell drinkers with fresh, clean water.\n\u2022 Provide 23 hours of light during the initial brooding days.",u.v,"To what temperature should the barn be preheated 24 hours before chick arrival?",B.qK,2,"Day-old chicks cannot regulate their own body temperature; preheating the barn floor and air to 33-34\xb0C prevents chilling and early mortality.")
B.X8=new A.cn(B.jo,"33\u201322\xb0C","\u0421\u043d\u0438\u0436\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0430 2\u20133\xb0C \u043a\u0430\u0436\u0434\u0443\u044e \u043d\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044e","1\u20133 \u0434\u043d\u0438: 33\u201334\xb0C \u2022 7 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c: 30\xb0C \u2022 14 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c: 27\xb0C \u2022 \u0441 28 \u0434\u043d\u044f: 20\u201322\xb0C.")
